\subsection{F6--F7: Interventions}
\label{sec:f6}

\paragraph{F6: $\dt{=}1$ imagination eliminates CIVO.}
\looseness=-1 Restricting imagination to $\dt{=}1$ while retaining the trained embedding (exp\_008e\_v3; Appendix~\ref{sec:code_corrections}) yields 0/4 CIVO (peak NVE ${\leq}0.8\times$); three seeds achieve $65$--$96\%$ of baseline (mean $775.6$; Figure~\ref{fig:multiple_pathways}). Multi-step imagination, not the trained embedding alone, is the necessary trigger for CIVO onset.

